.SH AUTH ON ACTION HOOKS
An auth on action policy can ask for a login again before these actions.
See
.B Auth On Action Policy
in
.BR otpme\-policy (1).
A vlan has the hooks every object type has, and these; a command of another name is in brackets:
.RS
.PP
.na
.nh
add_device, add_host, add_role, add_token, change_vlan_id\ (vlan_id), remove_device, remove_host, remove_role, remove_token, set_config_parameter\ (config).
.hy
.ad
