.SH FILES
.na
.nh
.TP
\fI/var/lib/otpme/tree/\fR
The objects of the realm.
A VLAN is the directory \fI<name>.vlan\fR in the directory of its unit, e.g. \fI<realm>.realm/<site>.site/vlans.unit/guests.vlan/\fR, with its settings in \fIobject.json\fR, on the nodes of every site, never on a host.
Change them with the commands above, not in the files.
.hy
